{
  "slug": "backlink-intelligence",
  "name": "Backlink Intelligence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Discover backlink opportunities, analyse competitor gaps, verify link quality, and find expired domains with existing authority. Uses Common Crawl across 3 indexes and DataForSEO to surface guest post prospects, resource pages, and brand mentions. Includes 4 skills: link-discovery, competitor-gap, link-verify, and expired-domains.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands** and **5 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `competitor-gap` (Analyse the backlink gap between your domain and up to 3 competitors), `expired-domains` (Find expired domains with existing backlink equity that could be used for 301 redirects or rebuilt as authority…), `link-discovery` (Discover backlink opportunities using Common Crawl indexes and DataForSEO), `link-verify` (Verify that acquired backlinks are live, followed, and pointing to the correct URL)\n- **Agents** (1): `link-campaign` (Autonomous link building campaign agent)\n- **Commands** (4): `discover` (Discover backlink prospects), `expired` (Find expired domains with backlink equity in your niche), `gap` (Competitor backlink gap analysis), `verify` (Verify acquired backlinks are live, followed, and pointing to the correct URL)\n- **MCP servers** (5): `~~serp_data`, `~~crawler`, `~~database`, `~~knowledge_base`, `~~documents`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install backlink-intelligence@claude-community` from `arturseo-geo/cowork-backlink-intelligence`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
